      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Bookshelf</title>\n  <style>\n    [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\n    :root {\n      --bg-color: #2b2236;\n      --wood-dark: #3a2010;\n      --wood-mid: #5c341b;\n      --wood-light: #844c26;\n      --gold: #f4b41b;\n      --parchment: #f0e6d2;\n      --text-dark: #221a14;\n      --border-pixel: 4px solid #140d07;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      background-color: var(--bg-color);\n      background-image:\n        linear-gradient(45deg, #241c2e 25%, transparent 25%),\n        linear-gradient(-45deg, #241c2e 25%, transparent 25%),\n        linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 75%, #241c2e 75%),\n        linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 75%, #241c2e 75%);\n      background-size: 16px 16px;\n      background-position: 0 0, 0 8px, 8px -8px, -8px 0px;\n      font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      color: var(--parchment);\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .app-card {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 680px;\n      background: var(--wood-mid);\n      border: var(--border-pixel);\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 0 #140d07, 0 16px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n      padding: 24px 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      text-align: center;\n      border-bottom: 4px dashed var(--wood-light);\n      padding-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 1.75rem;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      color: var(--gold);\n      text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #140d07;\n    }\n\n    .subtitle {\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n      color: var(--parchment);\n      opacity: 0.9;\n    }\n\n    .controls-panel {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 14px;\n      background: var(--wood-dark);\n      border: 4px solid #140d07;\n      padding: 14px;\n    }\n\n    @media (min-width: 520px) {\n      .controls-panel {\n        grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr;\n        align-items: end;\n      }\n    }\n\n    .control-group {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n\n    label {\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: var(--gold);\n      text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #000;\n    }\n\n    input, select, button {\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      background: var(--parchment);\n      color: var(--text-dark);\n      border: 3px solid #140d07;\n      padding: 8px 10px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      outline: none;\n      transition: transform 0.05s ease, background-color 0.1s ease;\n    }\n\n    input:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n      border-color: var(--gold);\n      outline: 3px solid var(--gold);\n      outline-offset: 1px;\n    }\n\n    button {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      background: var(--gold);\n      color: var(--text-dark);\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #140d07;\n      height: 44px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 4px;\n    }\n\n    button:hover {\n      background: #ffd043;\n    }\n\n    button:active {\n      transform: translateY(4px);\n      box-shadow: none;\n    }\n\n    .bookcase {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 28px;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .shelf {\n      position: relative;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      align-items: flex-end;\n      justify-content: center;\n      gap: 12px;\n      min-height: 190px;\n      padding: 0 12px 14px 12px;\n    }\n\n    .shelf::after {\n      content: '';\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 0;\n      left: -8px;\n      right: -8px;\n      height: 14px;\n      background: var(--wood-light);\n      border-top: 4px solid #140d07;\n      border-bottom: 6px solid #140d07;\n      box-shadow: inset 0 -3px 0 var(--wood-dark);\n    }\n\n    .book {\n      width: 60px;\n      height: var(--book-h, 160px);\n      background-color: var(--book-color, #c0392b);\n      border: 3px solid #140d07;\n      box-shadow: inset -4px 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.25), inset 4px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 8px 4px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      position: relative;\n      user-select: none;\n      transition: transform 0.15s steps(3);\n    }\n\n    .book:hover, .book:focus-visible {\n      transform: translateY(-8px);\n      outline: 3px solid var(--gold);\n    }\n\n    .book-spine-accent {\n      width: 80%;\n      height: 4px;\n      background: var(--gold);\n      box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n    }\n\n    .book-title-vertical {\n      writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n      text-orientation: mixed;\n      transform: rotate(180deg);\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #fff;\n      text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #000;\n      max-height: 90px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      text-overflow: ellipsis;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n    .book-year-tag {\n      font-size: 0.7rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: var(--parchment);\n      background: #140d07;\n      padding: 1px 3px;\n      border-radius: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .empty-state {\n      grid-column: 1 / -1;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 30px;\n      color: var(--parchment);\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .stats-bar {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n      color: var(--gold);\n      margin-top: -6px;\n    }\n\n    /* Detail Card Modal */\n    .book-details {\n      background: var(--wood-dark);\n      border: 3px solid #140d07;\n      padding: 12px 16px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .book-details h2 {\n      color: var(--gold);\n      font-size: 1.15rem;\n    }\n    .book-details p {\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"app-card\">\n    <header>\n      <h1>Pixel Bookshelf</h1>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">8 Classic Tomes of Adventure &amp; Code</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"controls-panel\" aria-label=\"Book search and sort options\">\n      <div class=\"control-group\">\n        <label for=\"search-input\">Search</label>\n        <input id=\"search-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Filter title or author...\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"control-group\">\n        <label for=\"sort-select\">Sort By</label>\n        <select id=\"sort-select\">\n          <option value=\"title\">Title</option>\n          <option value=\"author\">Author</option>\n          <option value=\"year\">Year</option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"control-group\">\n        <label for=\"order-btn\">Order</label>\n        <button id=\"order-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle sort direction: currently Ascending\">\n          <span id=\"order-label\">Ascending</span> <span id=\"order-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▲</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"stats-bar\" id=\"status-text\" aria-live=\"polite\">Showing 8 of 8 books</div>\n\n    <section class=\"bookcase\" aria-label=\"Pixel bookshelf shelves\">\n      <div class=\"shelf\" id=\"shelf-container\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"book-details\" id=\"detail-card\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Selected Book Information\">\n      <h2 id=\"detail-title\">Select a book</h2>\n      <p id=\"detail-author\">Click any spine on the shelf to inspect.</p>\n      <p id=\"detail-year\"></p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    const BOOKS = [\n      { id: 1, title: \"Dune\", author: \"Frank Herbert\", year: 1965, color: \"#c2593f\", height: 165 },\n      { id: 2, title: \"1984\", author: \"George Orwell\", year: 1949, color: \"#446b58\", height: 145 },\n      { id: 3, title: \"Neuromancer\", author: \"William Gibson\", year: 1984, color: \"#2e707e\", height: 155 },\n      { id: 4, title: \"The Hobbit\", author: \"J.R.R. Tolkien\", year: 1937, color: \"#8c5c36\", height: 150 },\n      { id: 5, title: \"Snow Crash\", author: \"Neal Stephenson\", year: 1992, color: \"#7b4478\", height: 170 },\n      { id: 6, title: \"Dracula\", author: \"Bram Stoker\", year: 1897, color: \"#852424\", height: 160 },\n      { id: 7, title: \"Fahrenheit 451\", author: \"Ray Bradbury\", year: 1953, color: \"#b87428\", height: 140 },\n      { id: 8, title: \"The Time Machine\", author: \"H.G. Wells\", year: 1895, color: \"#3f526b\", height: 135 }\n    ];\n\n    let currentSort = \"title\";\n    let isAscending = true;\n    let searchQuery = \"\";\n\n    const searchInput = document.getElementById(\"search-input\");\n    const sortSelect = document.getElementById(\"sort-select\");\n    const orderBtn = document.getElementById(\"order-btn\");\n    const orderLabel = document.getElementById(\"order-label\");\n    const orderIcon = document.getElementById(\"order-icon\");\n    const shelfContainer = document.getElementById(\"shelf-container\");\n    const statusText = document.getElementById(\"status-text\");\n    const detailTitle = document.getElementById(\"detail-title\");\n    const detailAuthor = document.getElementById(\"detail-author\");\n    const detailYear = document.getElementById(\"detail-year\");\n\n    function renderBooks() {\n      const filtered = BOOKS.filter(book => {\n        const q = searchQuery.trim().toLowerCase();\n        if (!q) return true;\n        return book.title.toLowerCase().includes(q) || book.author.toLowerCase().includes(q);\n      });\n\n      filtered.sort((a, b) => {\n        let valA = a[currentSort];\n        let valB = b[currentSort];\n\n        if (typeof valA === \"string\") {\n          const cmp = valA.localeCompare(valB);\n          return isAscending ? cmp : -cmp;\n        } else {\n          return isAscending ? valA - valB : valB - valA;\n        }\n      });\n\n      shelfContainer.innerHTML = \"\";\n\n      if (filtered.length === 0) {\n        const emptyMsg = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        emptyMsg.className = \"empty-state\";\n        emptyMsg.textContent = \"No pixel books found matching your query.\";\n        shelfContainer.appendChild(emptyMsg);\n        statusText.textContent = \"Showing 0 of \" + BOOKS.length + \" books\";\n        return;\n      }\n\n      statusText.textContent = \"Showing \" + filtered.length + \" of \" + BOOKS.length + \" books\";\n\n      filtered.forEach(book => {\n        const bookEl = document.createElement(\"button\");\n        bookEl.type = \"button\";\n        bookEl.className = \"book\";\n        bookEl.style.setProperty(\"--book-color\", book.color);\n        bookEl.style.setProperty(\"--book-h\", book.height + \"px\");\n        bookEl.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", book.title + \" by \" + book.author + \", published in \" + book.year);\n\n        const topBand = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        topBand.className = \"book-spine-accent\";\n\n        const titleEl = document.createElement(\"span\");\n        titleEl.className = \"book-title-vertical\";\n        titleEl.textContent = book.title;\n\n        const yearTag = document.createElement(\"span\");\n        yearTag.className = \"book-year-tag\";\n        yearTag.textContent = book.year;\n\n        const btmBand = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        btmBand.className = \"book-spine-accent\";\n\n        bookEl.appendChild(topBand);\n        bookEl.appendChild(titleEl);\n        bookEl.appendChild(yearTag);\n        bookEl.appendChild(btmBand);\n\n        bookEl.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n          detailTitle.textContent = book.title;\n          detailAuthor.textContent = \"Author: \" + book.author;\n          detailYear.textContent = \"Published: \" + book.year;\n        });\n\n        shelfContainer.appendChild(bookEl);\n      });\n    }\n\n    searchInput.addEventListener(\"input\", e => {\n      searchQuery = e.target.value;\n      renderBooks();\n    });\n\n    sortSelect.addEventListener(\"change\", e => {\n      currentSort = e.target.value;\n      renderBooks();\n    });\n\n    orderBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      isAscending = !isAscending;\n      orderLabel.textContent = isAscending ? \"Ascending\" : \"Descending\";\n      orderIcon.textContent = isAscending ? \"▲\" : \"▼\";\n      orderBtn.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", \"Toggle sort direction: currently \" + (isAscending ? \"Ascending\" : \"Descending\"));\n      renderBooks();\n    });\n\n    // Initial display\n    renderBooks();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": "Main single-page HTML document containing accessible controls, the pixel-art bookshelf layout, and integrated vanilla CSS/JS."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Bookshelf\n\nAn offline browser app built with pure HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript featuring a pixel-art bookshelf holding 8 classic books.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Pixel Art Aesthetic**: Hand-crafted CSS pixel borders, wood textures, and book spine dimensions without external image files or frameworks.\n- **8 Built-in Books**: Complete with `title`, `author`, and `year` attributes, distinct spine heights, and color palettes.\n- **Search Filtering**: Real-time filtering matching book titles or authors.\n- **Sorting & Toggle**: Sort ascending or descending across Title, Author, or Year with an accessible toggle button.\n- **Keyboard & Screen Reader Accessible**: Semantic inputs, custom focus states, `aria-label` tags, and live region announcements.\n- **Zero External Dependencies**: Operates 100% offline with system fonts and pure CSS rendering.\n\n## Running the Project\n\nOpen `index.html` directly in any modern web browser.\n",
      "description": "Project documentation including features, technical specs, and instructions for running the application."
    }
  ]
}